  "instructions": [
    "Heat the oil in a large paella pan or skillet over medium-high heat.",
    "Add the onion and bell pepper and cook until tender, about 5 minutes.",
    "Add the garlic, smoked paprika, and cumin. Cook for 1 minute.",
    "Add the tomato paste and cook for 1 minute.",
    "Add the vegetable broth and bring to a boil.",
    "Add the saffron threads and cook for 2 minutes.",
    "Add the rice noodles and cook for 2-3 minutes or until they start to soften.",
    "Transfer the pan to the oven and bake at 400°F (200°C) for 10-12 minutes or until the noodles are crispy and golden brown.",
    "Remove the pan from the oven and stir in the chopped peanuts and cilantro.",
    "Serve hot and enjoy!",
    "If desired, garnish with additional cilantro and peanuts."
